ng and attendance contract; parent contact for Kevin; finalize state testing proctor coverage. • Sandra Kowalski — start Tessa's weekly writing conference; coordinate Nadia's math support block with IEP case manager; check Thursday tutoring room availability. • Marisol Vega — send mentor reflection form to Leila and Aiden; share Q4 intervention planning doc with the four SST staff tomorrow. • All staff — review Q3 progress-report data before next SST meeting. — End of summary — To: marisol.vega@riverbendhs.org, denise.okafor@riverbendhs.org, martin.alvarez@riverbendhs.org, sandra.kowalski@riverbendhs.org

